    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Have you ever felt like a rabbit with a telephone?</strong> Ana is a wartime telephone operator learning how to navigate the world without her dear sister.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved game-jam sweetheart   is back in remastered form, featuring an overhauled script, new CGs, updated sprites, sounds &amp; music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incoming call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The job title of switchboard operator used to be respectable</strong>,\u00a0but in this world of progress the old must give way to the new. Over time, the position shrank to being nothing more than unappreciated busy work. Even so, there are some that find value in this important task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ana gets a letter one day, stating that she will be out of work for a while as repairs are performed on her post. Follow Ana in this historical setting as she explores the boundaries of her world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello Girl may contain...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlikely bonds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your local postal worker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of Sisters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm scared of the radio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global conspiracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri(?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330860/extras/e6f93b7cd40f7a7385095aedeadfb83e.avif?t=1748908211\" width=206 height=69 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Have you ever felt like a rabbit with a telephone?</strong> Ana is a wartime telephone operator learning how to navigate the world without her dear sister.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved game-jam sweetheart   is back in remastered form, featuring an overhauled script, new CGs, updated sprites, sounds &amp; music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incoming call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The job title of switchboard operator used to be respectable</strong>,\u00a0but in this world of progress the old must give way to the new. Over time, the position shrank to being nothing more than unappreciated busy work. Even so, there are some that find value in this important task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ana gets a letter one day, stating that she will be out of work for a while as repairs are performed on her post. Follow Ana in this historical setting as she explores the boundaries of her world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello Girl may contain...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlikely bonds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your local postal worker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of Sisters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm scared of the radio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global conspiracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri(?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330860/extras/e6f93b7cd40f7a7385095aedeadfb83e.avif?t=1748908211\" width=206 height=69 /></span></p>",
